##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# GitHub #205: the shading rate under depth of field. focusfactor 0.5: the rate is multiplied by max(1, 0.5 * circle of confusion in pixels), as it was before the attribute.
# A 10 x 6 polygon facing the camera, ShadingRate 1, far from the focal plane (focal distance 2, polygon at 10):
# test_dof_shading_rate counts the vertices the rasterizer shades, from the end-of-frame statistics.
version 3.03
Hider "zbuffer"
Display "dof-shading-rate-focusfactor-zbuffer.tif" "file" "rgb"
Format 200 150 1
PixelSamples 1 1
ShadingRate 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 45
DepthOfField 2 1 2
Translate 0 0 10
WorldBegin
  GeometricApproximation "focusfactor" 0.5
  Polygon "P" [-5 -3 0  5 -3 0  5 3 0  -5 3 0]

WorldEnd
